 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Script-Eating Actor"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "책 먹는 배우님"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Jaehee, why do you always carry two copies of the script?\"\n\"Well, I might lose one.\"\n\nThat’s a lie.\nOne is for carrying around on set and showing to others.\nThe other one is for—\n\n[The drama Youth Train is available for absorption.]\n[Would you like to absorb it?]\n\nI use it for eating.\nI devour the script and make it completely my own.\n\nThe story of Jaehui, an actor who can absorb a script 100%."
  },
